    {
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<p>This was a 2-week Game Jam where my team and I worked to create a game based on the theme of “connections”. My primary role was Level Design and Environmental Art. I created both worlds and created the entire menu scene. I also aided in programming the puzzle mechanics for the game and individually created some puzzles with them as well.</p>"
    },
